OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of sunny spells and
OL,6,Fshowers, with outbreaks always focused
OL,7,Facross the Western Isles and western
OL,8,Fcoastal districts, with Inverness in
OL,9,Fthe best of the shelter. Southwest
OL,10,Fwinds strong to near gale across the
OL,11,FIsles and western coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers building from the
OL,14,Fwest through the evening, some turning
OL,15,Fheavy and bringing the risk of hail
OL,16,Fand thunder, chiefly in the west.
OL,17,FSouthwest wind strong in north and
OL,18,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
