OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FBrighter spells and
OL,6,Fscattered showers through to mid-
OL,7,Fafternoon. Showers building from the
OL,8,Fwest after mid-afternoon, bringing the
OL,9,Frisk of hail and thunder from the
OL,10,Fevening, chiefly across western
OL,11,Fdistricts.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,14,FUnsettled for Sunday with showers or
OL,15,Flonger periods of rain, with Inverness
OL,16,Fseeing best of shelter. A few light
OL,17,Fscattered showers on Monday. Tuesday
OL,18,Fturning wet and windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
